msgid "https://stefanwarnat.de"
msgstr "https://stefanwarnat.de"

#. Description of the plugin
#: sw-mailgate.php
msgid "Send WordPress mail through SMTP, Mailgun, Google or Microsoft 365 with failover, redirection, logging and DNS checks."
msgstr "WordPress-E-Mails über SMTP, Mailgun, Google oder Microsoft 365 versenden – mit Ausfallsicherung, Umleitung, Protokollierung und DNS-Prüfungen."

#. Author of the plugin
#: sw-mailgate.php
msgid "Stefan Warnat"
msgstr "Stefan Warnat"

